{"seq":1,"slug":"realtime-foundations","title":"实时基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/realtime-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"websocket-and-sse","title":"WebSocket 与 SSE","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/realtime-foundations/websocket-and-sse","wordCount":1957,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"webrtc-peer-to-peer","title":"WebRTC 与点对点通信","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/realtime-foundations/webrtc-peer-to-peer","wordCount":1498,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"transport-selection","title":"传输协议选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/realtime-foundations/transport-selection","wordCount":1602,"readingTime":7},{"seq":4,"slug":"scaling-realtime","title":"实时系统扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/realtime-foundations/scaling-realtime","wordCount":1707,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 实时基础\n\n实时通信的\"概念奠基\"——选对传输方式决定协作应用的性能与复杂度。WebSocket（双向长连接、低延迟、扩展复杂）、Server-Sent Events（服务端单向推送、HTTP 友好、实现简单）、WebRTC（端到端直连、视频 / 语音 / 数据通道、无需占用服务器带宽）——各自适合不同的应用场景。长轮询、Comet 是历史上的回退方案。把实时服务端扩到大规模是架构挑战——连接状态管理、水平扩展、消息代理（如 Redis 发布订阅）、扇出广播。本章覆盖 WebSocket / SSE / WebRTC 的接口与适用场景、传输方式的选型准则、扩展架构。学完本章你能为场景选对传输方式、搭建基础的 WebSocket 应用、把实时服务端扩到十万级以上的并发连接。\n"}